# location-tracking-system

The location tracking system implements a multi-provider geolocation verification workflow for bond compliance monitoring:

## Core Components

1. Provider Fallback Chain
- Primary GPS consent-based tracking
- Secondary IP-based location detection
- Tertiary cell tower triangulation 
- Final fallback to rough regional estimation

2. Compliance Verification Logic
- Mandatory accuracy radius requirements
- Maximum allowed drift calculations
- Geographic boundary enforcement
- Time-window validation for check-ins

3. Location Security Measures
- VPN/proxy detection and blocking
- Multi-point verification cross-checks
- Location spoofing prevention
- Historical pattern analysis

4. Administrative Tracking
- Last known area monitoring
- Geographic violation alerts
- Compliance boundary management
- Location history retention

## Integration Points

1. Check-in Workflow
- GPS permission capture
- Accuracy validation
- Boundary verification
- Compliance status recording

2. Geographic Data Flow
- Raw coordinate capture
- Accuracy radius calculation 
- Provider verification chain
- Location persistence

